# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# Dependencies & build outputs
/node_modules
/.next/
/out/
/coverage

# Tooling caches & logs
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
npm-debug.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Local-only files
.DS_Store
.env*
*.pem

# CV workspace — local-only drafts shared via the CV.md interview flow.
CV-RAW.md
CV-POLISHED.md
CV.md
GEMINI-VOICE-PROMPT.md

# CV pipeline artifacts. All produced inside the multi-stage Dockerfile —
# either baked into the production image (CI) or written to the cv-bundle
# Docker volume (`make up`). If anything ever lands on the host (an IDE
# integration running xelatex in-place, a stray docker run -v, etc.) keep
# it out of git.
latex/output/
latex/*.aux
latex/*.log
latex/*.out
latex/*.synctex.gz
latex/*.fls
latex/*.fdb_latexmk
latex/*.pdf
latex/*.tex
latex/cv/
latex/resume/
public/resume.pdf
public/cv-*.pdf
public/cv-manifest.json
